.card.border-0.bg-light
  .card-body
    %h2.h5 Goal of this page
    %p.mb-3
      Review apply-ready
      %strong Position create
      proposals — usually drafted via Suggest MAAP changes when someone describes a role that needs a Title + level Position.

    %h2.h5 How create proposals move
    %ol.mb-0
      %li Someone confirms a MAAP Suggestion that includes a new Position (often with a linked Title create).
      %li The draft appears here and in the MAAP Cleanup Inbox when submitted.
      %li Apply needs a resolved Title. Prefer applying linked Title creates first, then Position.
      %li A Position creator applies or rejects.
